   "install": {
    "title": "Installation",
    "html": "<p>There are two ways to start using Appsmith:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Signup on <a href=\"https://login.appsmith.com/?utm_source=github&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=readme\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Appsmith Cloud</a>.</li>\n<li>Install Appsmith on your machine. See the installation guides below.</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Installation Methods</th>\n<th>Documentation</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.appsmith.com/getting-started/setup/installation-guides/docker?utm_source=github&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=readme\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Docker</a> (<em>Recommended</em>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.appsmith.com/getting-started/setup/installation-guides/kubernetes?utm_source=github&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=readme\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Kubernetes</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://docs.appsmith.com/getting-started/setup/installation-guides/aws-ami?utm_source=github&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=readme\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AWS AMI</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>For other deployment options, see the <a href=\"https://docs.appsmith.com/getting-started/setup/installation-guides?utm_source=github&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=readme\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Installation Guides</a> documentation.  </p>",
